        "object_label": "ONE SEARCH HIT",
        "left": "REST-UV MAGNITUDE AND REDSHIFT IN ONE TABLE",
        "right": "A NAME OR TAG WITHOUT A USABLE OBJECT PAIR",
        "bottom": "REACHABILITY ALONE DOES NOT CREATE AN EVIDENCE PLANE"
